{
  "schemaVersion": "1.1.0",
  "id": "connect-agent-to-agent-observability-enable-agent-observability",
  "title": "Enable Agent Observability",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "A Grafana Cloud administrator must enable Agent Observability for your stack. Sign in to Grafana Cloud as an administrator before you start. Grafana Admins have the Agent Observability Admin role by default."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Open Agent Observability and accept the terms if they appear."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "enable-agent-observability",
      "title": "Enable Agent Observability",
      "autoCollapse": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "content": "Navigate to **Observability** > **Agent**.\n\nIf the app opens and there is no terms screen, Agent Observability is already enabled. You can proceed to the next milestone.",
          "requirements": ["navmenu-open"],
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "a[data-testid='data-testid Nav menu item'][href='/observability']",
              "requirements": ["exists-reftarget"]
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "a[data-testid='data-testid Nav menu item'][href='/a/grafana-agento11y-app']",
              "requirements": ["exists-reftarget"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "button",
          "reftarget": "Save",
          "content": "Review and accept the terms, then click **Save**.",
          "requirements": ["on-page:/a/grafana-agento11y-app", "exists-reftarget"],
          "doIt": false,
          "skippable": true,
          "hint": "Don't see a terms screen or a **Save** button? Agent Observability is already enabled on this stack. You can skip this step."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Agent Observability is enabled on your stack."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "---\n\n### More to explore (optional)\n\n- [Enable Agent Observability](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/observe-and-act/agent-observability/get-started/grafana-cloud/#enable-agent-observability)\n- [Agent Observability pricing](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/observe-and-act/agent-observability/pricing/)"
    }
  ]
}
